ps://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/82/1qggrcdye8htgurmidu1m6cvfipqy6q.png/98px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E5%A5%87%E8%A2%AD%E4%B9%8B%E9%81%93.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/82/1qggrcdye8htgurmidu1m6cvfipqy6q.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div class=\"gx_name\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E5%A5%87%E8%A2%AD%E4%B9%8B%E9%81%93\" title=\"极限解放/暗影奇袭之道\"><font color=\"#FFF\">暗影奇袭之道</font></a></div>\n    </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:15%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色绰号\n</th>\n<td>大哈沙、女帝、裸女\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配置推荐\n</th>\n<td>同下\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色攻略\n</th>\n<td>【by超能缪缪】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F697781863934066754\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/697781863934066754</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">中文CV\n</th>\n<td>王雅欣\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">日文CV\n</th>\n<td>石川由依\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配音展示\n</th>\n<td>【byThAmeReborn】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15cbDzdE6e\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15cbDzdE6e</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色生平\n</th>\n<td>青春常驻的沙漠帝王。露卡玛尔行事放浪形骸，有着让人捉摸不透的危险而魅惑的气质。表面上看，她是一位纵情享乐的君主——常年浸泡着珍贵的风息粉尘，兴之所至纵情舞蹈，她的神秘与危险令奴隶主与商人畏惧臣服。<br />而在这奢靡的表象下，隐藏着令人敬畏的远见。由她开创的国家商人制度，为埃拉曼带来了前所未有的繁荣，商路如流淌黄金的血脉，供养着哈沙拉姆这颗璀璨的沙漠之心。新兴商人阶级对贵族奴隶主手中的权力虎视眈眈，而她以精妙的制衡之术操控朝局，玩味地旁观着这场残酷的权力角逐。<br />对露卡玛尔而言，诸国命运不过是她棋盘上的余兴。而她真正渴求之物，却无人知晓。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>原皮肤像素模型</th>\n<th>皮肤像素模型\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50%;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E9%9C%B2%E5%8D%A1%E7%8E%9B%E5%B0%94_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"露卡玛尔 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/n2uowb0rxfr1euay0wp1rbtft9sl5p7.png/100px-%E9%9C%B2%E5%8D%A1%E7%8E%9B%E5%B0%94_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ec/n2uowb0rxfr1euay0wp1rbtft9sl5p7.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50%;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E9%9C%B2%E5%8D%A1%E7%8E%9B%E5%B0%94_%E7%9A%AE%E8%82%A4%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"露卡玛尔 皮肤像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/35/5qna3mu6vy8kb2ziopx2w68s3xau1gp.png/100px-%E9%9C%B2%E5%8D%A1%E7%8E%9B%E5%B0%94_%E7%9A%AE%E8%82%A4%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/35/5qna3mu6vy8kb2ziopx2w68s3xau1gp.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">皮肤演示视频\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p>【by 白骑一护】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ui8vz6E3S\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ui8vz6E3S</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022065553\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: fals